## Key results (from the current run)

| Area | Result |
|---|---|
| Extracted & cleansed | 1,067,371 raw â†’ 1,010,534 sales + 22,497 returns + 34,340 quarantined, **reconciled to the row** |
| Integrated | Star schema in PostgreSQL 18 â€” **Python = Postgres to the penny** (`matches_python: true`) |
| SQL analytics | 22 queries across sales, customers, products, profitability |
| EDA | 12 figures; best month Nov-2011 Â£1,456k; YoY like-for-like **+1.8%**; churn **50.9%**; 1,640 dead SKUs |
| Segmentation | RFM (+K-Means, silhouette 0.43); **Champions+Loyal = 80.4% of revenue** |
| Churn | Best model **Logistic Regression AUC 0.768** (isotonic-calibrated); 2,495 High-risk customers = **Â£1.53M** revenue at risk |
| Forecast | **Seasonal Naive, 6.1% WMAPE** backtest; next quarter **Â£1.80M** (95% band Â£1.29â€“2.32M); next 12m **Â£9.32M** |
| Business story | `reports/business_insights.md`, `reports/recommendations.md` (P0/P1/P2), 6-page Power BI build |

